      E_B   = -2*C - 2*b*J(s0**2)
      E_phi = 0
      E_A - (1/2) E_B = 2*b*s0**2*Subs(Derivative(J(_xi_1), _xi_1), _xi_1, s0**2)
  [PASS] B1 [THE RELAY] E_A - (1/2)E_B = 2 b J'(s0^2) s0^2 on the flat/uniform-gradient background, derived from my own variation of my own rebuilt density -- the relayed formula is CORRECT AS STATED   (difference simplifies to 0)
